member.summary:
H_2(p) in nats: −p ln p − (1−p) ln(1−p). Zero at
the endpoints (handled explicitly to avoid log(0));
ln 2 at p = 0.5.

Friends-of-friends threshold; pairs with
⟨1_{s_i=s_j}⟩ > Theta get unioned. Defaults to 0.5;
canonically insensitive across [0.2, 0.9].

Independent replicas per (Temperature, Round) task. Each replica is its
own fresh PottsModel with a deterministic per-task seed (derived from
); their χ measurements are averaged to drive
down variance at each grid point. Set together with
 for total measurements per T =
DenseReplicas × DenseRounds.
